# Savior of the Sleeping: two enchantments put into a graveyard at the same time trigger it twice. Turn 1: Savior of the
# Sleeping (2/3) and Ornithopter. Turn 3: Holy Strength and Lance enchant Ornithopter, then Swords to Plowshares exiles it
# (the creature is exiled, not put into a graveyard: no counter for it) and both Auras go to Bot1's graveyard as a
# state-based action (CR 704.5m): two counters, a 4/5 Savior. Plain Ornithopter dying would add none.

